# Error Log

Active issues being worked. Findings from reviews, audits, and debugging sessions that need addressing.

> **Severity scale:**
> - **Critical** — exploitable now, data loss possible, auth/authz broken
> - **High** — exploitable with effort, significant business risk
> - **Medium** — quality/maintainability issue, latent risk, minor security concern
> - **Low** — style, optimization, defense-in-depth improvement
>
> Every finding gets fixed, formally waived in `WAIVER-LOG.md`, or escalated to `VENDOR-LOG.md`. No silent skipping.

