## Entry Template

Copy this template for each new entry.

```
### ERR-YYYY-MM-DD-NNN

**Severity:** Critical | High | Medium | Low
**Source:** [Stage 5 Phase X review / Baseline audit phase Y / Debugging / User report / etc.]
**Discovered:** YYYY-MM-DD
**Rule violated (if applicable):** [Citation, e.g., `OWASP ASVS V3.1.1`]
**Description:** [What's wrong — concrete and specific.]
**Impact:** [Plain-language consequence — what could happen.]
**Location:** [File:line, or area of codebase.]
**Remediation:** [What needs to be done.]
**Target resolution:** YYYY-MM-DD
**Status:** Open | In Progress | Blocked | Resolved
**Resolution (when closed):** [What was done.]
```

